# topology.obligations — disposition for every `allium plan` obligation of topology.allium.
#   <id> => structural | test:<name> exercises=<symbol> | waived: <reason>
# The behavioural obligations, including the SP2 node presence (call/0012), get runnable
# tests under plan/0005 once the driver builds from the vendored DDK bundle (call/0008).

# --- Spec-integrity (covered by the check/analyse lane) ---
config-default.sp2_mode_count     => structural
enum-comparable.ControlKind       => structural
entity-fields.Node                => structural
entity-fields.Mixer               => structural
surface-actor.Topology            => structural
surface-provides.Topology         => structural

# --- Behavioural (no runnable tests yet; discharged under plan/0005) ---
rule-success.CoreNodeReachable        => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0005 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-failure.CoreNodeReachable.1      => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0005 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.Sp2NodeTracksHardware    => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0005 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-failure.Sp2NodeTracksHardware.1  => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0005 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.SurroundResolves         => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0005 (needs a build; call/0008)
